</em><em>(Run Away Farm Fitz x Conasauga Sapphire)</em></p><p><strong>RUN AWAY FARM CANTER,</strong> <em>13½&#8221;, Tan/White, Broken<br />
</em><em>(Winslow Farms Casper x Run Away Farm Taz)<br />
(Co-owned with Martha Milligan)</em></p><h4>Our Girls:</h4><p><strong>CONQUEST KIWI,</strong> <em>13¼&#8221;, Tricolor, Broken</em><br />
